🔑 KEY INSIGHTS:
======================================================================

1. Feature Distribution Shift:
   28/28 features show significant distribution differences
   This indicates substantial domain shift between telescopes

2. Transfer Learning Performance:
   Kepler→TESS transfer gap: 47.21%
   TESS→Kepler transfer gap: 15.19%
   → TESS generalizes better to Kepler than vice versa

3. Mixed Training Benefits:
   Adding 20% TESS data helps balance telescope bias
   Kepler test accuracy: 0.7930
   TESS test accuracy: 0.7304
   Difference: 6.27%

